1110
00:41:54,640 --> 00:41:58,880
The more components you add, red,

1111
00:41:56,640 --> 00:42:00,720
orange, green, blue, all slightly

1112
00:41:58,880 --> 00:42:03,200
shifted, the narrower and sharper that

1113
00:42:00,720 --> 00:42:06,400
envelope becomes. This figure visually

1114
00:42:03,200 --> 00:42:08,000
shows exactly that. With two components,

1115
00:42:06,400 --> 00:42:10,319
you can still see the oscillations

1116
00:42:08,000 --> 00:42:12,480
clearly. Add three components and the

1117
00:42:10,319 --> 00:42:14,160
interference gets tighter. Add seven

1118
00:42:12,480 --> 00:42:15,839
components and now the oscillations

1119
00:42:14,160 --> 00:42:19,440
