1128
00:42:33,760 --> 00:42:37,119
combine, the shorter the coherence

1129
00:42:35,520 --> 00:42:39,440
length becomes and the interference

1130
00:42:37,119 --> 00:42:42,440
fringes appear only within that small

1131
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:42,440
