1168
00:44:03,440 --> 00:44:07,760
is really doing physically is performing

1169
00:44:05,599 --> 00:44:10,000
a furier transform of the source

1170
00:44:07,760 --> 00:44:12,400
spectrum. The detected interference

1171
00:44:10,000 --> 00:44:14,720
pattern is the coine transform of the

1172
00:44:12,400 --> 00:44:16,720
spectral density.

1173
00:44:14,720 --> 00:44:18,640
So when you move the mirror and record

1174
00:44:16,720 --> 00:44:20,640
how the intensity changes, you're

1175
00:44:18,640 --> 00:44:23,760
effectively mapping out the coherence

1176
00:44:20,640 --> 00:44:25,359
function of the light. When the optical

1177
00:44:23,760 --> 00:44:27,520
path difference matches within the

1178
00:44:25,359 --> 00:44:30,000
coherence length of the source, you get

1179
00:44:27,520 --> 00:44:31,760
visible fringes. As soon as you move

1180
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:33,280
beyond that range, the interference

1181
00:44:31,760 --> 00:44:36,640
fades away because the different

1182
00:44:33,280 --> 00:44:38,800
