1199
00:45:10,640 --> 00:45:14,480
That's the basic principle of how

1200
00:45:12,319 --> 00:45:18,839
optical coherence tomography captures

1201
00:45:14,480 --> 00:45:18,839
structure in depth using interference.

1202
00:45:20,560 --> 00:45:24,400
This same principle is used in many

1203
00:45:22,400 --> 00:45:26,160
important applications. One of the most

1204
00:45:24,400 --> 00:45:28,160
famous examples is the Michaelelsson

1205
00:45:26,160 --> 00:45:30,240
interpherometer which was not just used

1206
00:45:28,160 --> 00:45:32,560
