1237
00:46:47,359 --> 00:46:50,800
detector.

1238
00:46:48,960 --> 00:46:52,880
What's fascinating is that this same

1239
00:46:50,800 --> 00:46:54,880
interferometer was used by Michaelelsson

1240
00:46:52,880 --> 00:46:57,680
and Moley in one of the most famous

1241
00:46:54,880 --> 00:46:59,599
experiments in physics history.

1242
00:46:57,680 --> 00:47:01,520
They wanted to test whether the speed of

1243
00:46:59,599 --> 00:47:03,359
light changes depending on the motion of

1244
00:47:01,520 --> 00:47:06,000
the Earth, whether it moves through

1245
00:47:03,359 --> 00:47:07,839
something called the ether.

1246
00:47:06,000 --> 00:47:09,839
The experiment was performed at Case

1247
00:47:07,839 --> 00:47:11,599
Western University and at that time

1248
00:47:09,839 --> 00:47:13,520
people expected to see a shift in the

1249
00:47:11,599 --> 00:47:15,599
interference pattern as the apparatus

1250
00:47:13,520 --> 00:47:17,440
