1251
00:47:15,599 --> 00:47:19,040
slightly faster in one direction than

1252
00:47:17,440 --> 00:47:21,280
another.

1253
00:47:19,040 --> 00:47:23,280
But no shift was observed. The result

1254
00:47:21,280 --> 00:47:25,119
was completely null. That means the

1255
00:47:23,280 --> 00:47:27,040
speed of light was constant in all

1256
00:47:25,119 --> 00:47:30,720
directions independent of the motion of

1257
00:47:27,040 --> 00:47:32,560
the source or the observer.

1258
00:47:30,720 --> 00:47:34,800
That single observation changed the

1259
00:47:32,560 --> 00:47:36,400
world of physics. It showed that light

1260
00:47:34,800 --> 00:47:38,800
doesn't behave the way classical

1261
00:47:36,400 --> 00:47:40,800
mechanics predicted. A few years later,

1262
00:47:38,800 --> 00:47:42,800
Albert Einstein took that result and

1263
00:47:40,800 --> 00:47:44,800
built his theory of special relativity

1264
00:47:42,800 --> 00:47:47,839
around it, declaring the speed of light

1265
00:47:44,800 --> 00:47:50,160
to be constant for all observers.

1266
00:47:47,839 --> 00:47:51,680
So, this simple optical instrument based

1267
00:47:50,160 --> 00:47:53,520
on the same interference principles

1268
00:47:51,680 --> 00:47:56,160
we've been discussing essentially marked

1269
00:47:53,520 --> 00:47:57,920
the birth of modern physics. The

1270
00:47:56,160 --> 00:48:00,160
Michaelelsson interferometer not only

1271
00:47:57,920 --> 00:48:01,920
explains how OCT works, but also

1272
00:48:00,160 --> 00:48:04,240
represents the bridge between classical

1273
00:48:01,920 --> 00:48:06,160
and modern physics. It's a truly

1274
00:48:04,240 --> 00:48:09,960
beautiful piece of science. Elegant,

1275
00:48:06,160 --> 00:48:09,960
powerful, and revolutionary.

1276
00:48:11,599 --> 00:48:15,920
Now, let's talk about the principle of

1277
00:48:13,200 --> 00:48:17,520
OCT. It's really the same idea as what

1278
00:48:15,920 --> 00:48:19,680
