1302
00:49:03,280 --> 00:49:07,119
It penetrates a little, hits various

1303
00:49:05,200 --> 00:49:08,880
microructures at different depths, and

1304
00:49:07,119 --> 00:49:11,760
each layer reflects part of the light

1305
00:49:08,880 --> 00:49:13,440
